# Considered and kept
#
# `harness` is the GLOSSARY.md glossary term for the UI test harness, and rule 1
# of docs/standards/coding-standards.md requires that word.
# `solution` names the .NET solution file, FsHttp.Studio.slnx.
# `richly` is the one-line description of what this extension does.
