# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The antithesis and the em dash
#
# docs/standards/technical-prose.md states both rules.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
, not	Assert the fact directly. Delete the negated half.
, and (not|never) 	Assert the fact directly. Delete the negated half.
\bnot [^.,;]{1,40}(, but |but rather )	Assert the fact directly. Delete the negated half.
\bnot (just|merely|simply|only)	Assert the fact directly. Delete the negated half.
(is|are|was|were) not [^.]{1,40}\. (it|they) (is|are|was|were)	Assert the fact directly. Delete the negated half.
—	Use a comma, a colon, or a period.
